      "result": "confirmed-source-defect-hold",
      "reason": "Confirmed. s0544–s0546 and s0559 recount 西晉武帝太康十年/泰始八年; s0592–s0594 explicitly switch to 孝武帝太元十年 and Xie An. No speech or flashback makes the two rulers identical.",
      "sourcePin": {
        "sourcePath": "data/jinshu/028.json",
        "extractionPath": "data/people/extractions/jinshu/028.json",
